<title>USA: Diagnostic Health Q1 net increases.</title>
<headline>Diagnostic Health Q1 net increases.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>FOR THE THREE MONTHS</p>
<p>					     ENDED</p>
<p>					   March 31,</p>
<p>					 1997		1996</p>
<p> NET REVENUES	     $ 10,509,976     $ 5,221,481</p>
<p> NET INCOME		    1,020,632	   458,835</p>
<p>EARNINGS PER SHARE:</p>
<p>  PRIMARY			     0.10		0.08</p>
<p>  FULLY DILUTED		     0.10		0.08</p>
<p>WEIGHTED AVERAGE</p>
<p>COMMON SHARES OUTSTANDING:</p>
<p>  PRIMARY			9,767,989	 5,944,142</p>
<p>  FULLY DILUTED		9,826,924	 6,075,019</p>
<p>NOTE:  Full name of company is Diagnostic Health Services Inc.</p>
</text>
